    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 75 Fairgreen Park is a lovely 3 bedroom semi-detached home, c.102 sq.m located in a small development on outskirts of Mullagh village. The property is in great condition throughout and is ready for immediate occupation, making it an ideal choice for anyone looking to move straight in.\nAccommodation includes entrance hallway, living room, kitchen, utility, guest w.c, three bedrooms, ensuite main bathroom. The property is nicely positioned overlooking a green area to the front benefits from a spacious garden to the rear. \n\nMullagh is a friendly and growing community with a range of local amenities including primary schools, sports clubs and scenic countryside walks. Conveniently located c,12km from Kells, c. 11km from Virginia c. 19km away from access to the M3 Motorway which provides direct access to Navan and Dublin.\n\nEntrance Hallway\nBright and welcoming hallway with wooden flooring.\n\nLiving Room\nWooden flooring with open fire in a cast iron fireplace.\n\nKitchen/Dining\nLight-filled and spacious Kitchen/Dining Room with a fitted kitchen and ample space for a dining table. An ideal setting for family living and entertaining, with double doors opening directly onto the garden.\n\nUtility\nFully plumbed Utility Room with fitted units providing excellent storage and a back door leading directly to the garden.\n\nGuest W.C.\nPartially tiled with W.C. and W.H.B.\n\nBedroom 1\nTo the front. Spacious double bedroom with wooden flooring. Access to en-suite.\n\nEnSuite/Shower Room\nPartially tiled. Electric shower, W.C. and W.H.B.\n\nBedroom 2\nTo the rear. Double room with wooden flooring.\n\nBedroom 3\nTo the front. Wooden flooring.\n\nBathroom\nPartially tiled with bath, W.C. and W.H.B.\n\nOutside\nCobblelock driveway to the side of the property providing ample parking. Large lawned rear garden with a patio area. Gated access from the front of the property to the rear garden.\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Lovely 3 bedroom home in a small residential development\nShort walk to local schools, shops and village amenities\nEasy access to the M3 motorway for commuting\nStrong local community with schools, sports clubs and countryside nearby\nOverlooking a nice green area to the front\nGarden shed to rear"
      },
